{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--ku-ci-contraction-saru-chitose","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--vowel-deletion"],"statement":{"en":"In the Saru and Chitose dialects, the personal affixes ku= and ci= contract to k= and c= respectively before words beginning with the vowels a, u, e, or o.","ja":"沙流方言および千歳方言において、人称接辞 ku= および ci= は母音 a, u, e, o で始まる語の前でそれぞれ k= および c= に縮約する。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":["before-a-u-e-o"]},"forms":["ku=","ci=","k=","c="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0106-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:nakagawafukazawa2022@handbook-epub/l0051-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--in-shizunai-ainu-ellipsis-of-a-pronominal-affix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--connected-speech"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai Ainu, ellipsis of a pronominal affix is permitted, though not required, when it occurs more than once with two closely connected verbals.","ja":"静内アイヌ語では、密接に関連する2つの動詞表現に伴って人称接辞が複数回現れる場合、その省略が義務的ではないものの許容される。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"possible","conditions":["when occurring more than once with two closely connected verbals"]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0018-04","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--across-word-boundaries-an-initial-yv-sequence-can","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--connected-speech"],"statement":{"en":"Across word boundaries, an initial yV- sequence can drop y- after a consonant-final word.","ja":"-C + yV- → -CV- : koytak an < koytak「話しかける」, yan「なさい」"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":["after a consonant-final form"]},"forms":["-C","yV-","-CV-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0030-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--the-middle-voice-nominalizing-prefix-ci-loses-its","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--i-block"],"statement":{"en":"The middle-voice/nominalizing prefix ci- loses its vowel i before vowels a and o, paralleling the morphophonology of the 1st person plural prefix ci=.","ja":"中動態・名詞化の接頭辞ci-は、人称接辞ci=と同様に母音a, oの前でiが脱落する。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["before /a/ and /o/"]},"forms":["ci-","ci="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0586-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--when-ku-occurs-before-the-vowel-i-followed","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--i-block"],"statement":{"en":"When ku- occurs before the vowel i followed by a single consonant, the i becomes y and the accent shifts from i to u, yielding the surface form kúy-.","ja":"ku-「私が」が母音 i の前（ただし i の直後に子音が一つの場合）に立つと i は y となり、アクセントは i から u へ移動して kúy という形になる。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["before i followed by a single consonant"]},"forms":["ku-","kúy-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0127-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--when-the-second-person-singular-prefix-e-attaches","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--i-block"],"statement":{"en":"When the second-person singular prefix e- attaches to an initial i followed by a single consonant, the i becomes y and the accent shifts to e-.","ja":"e-「お前が」が付くと、i は y となり、アクセントは e に移る。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["before i followed by a single consonant"]},"forms":["e-","é-y"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0128-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--the-verb-ipe-to-eat-becomes-ype-after","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--i-block"],"statement":{"en":"The verb ipe 'to eat' becomes ype after the first-person singular prefix ku-.","ja":"動詞 ipe「食べる」は1人称単数接頭辞 ku- の後で ype となる。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["after ku-"]},"forms":["ipe","ku-","ku-ype"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0167-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--except-in-saru-chitose-and-mukawa-dialects-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--vowel-deletion"],"statement":{"en":"Except in Saru, Chitose, and Mukawa dialects, the vowel contraction of ku= and ci= before vowels does not occur in most dialects, retaining two syllables.","ja":"沙流・千歳・鵡川を除く大部分の方言では、母音の前での ku=, ci= の母音縮約は起こらず、ku=ómare のような2音節の形を保つ。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":["except Saru, Chitose, and Mukawa dialects"]},"forms":["ku=","ci="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0050-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--in-the-saru-chitose-and-mukawa-dialects-personal","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--vowel-deletion"],"statement":{"en":"In the Saru, Chitose, and Mukawa dialects, personal affixes ku= and ci= contract to k= and c= before vowel-initial verbs or nouns, whereas such contraction does not occur in other dialects.","ja":"沙流・千歳・鵡川などの方言では、人称接辞 ku=、ci= が母音始まりの動詞または名詞の前で k=、c= に縮約されるが、それ以外の方言ではそのような現象は起きない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:hokkaido/southwest/mukawa","doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["before vowel-initial verbs or nouns"]},"forms":["ku=","ci=","k=","c="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0108-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--in-western-hidaka-and-chitose-dialects-k-u","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--vowel-deletion"],"statement":{"en":"In Western Hidaka and Chitose dialects, k(u)= and c(i)= drop u and i respectively before words beginning with a, u, e, or o, so that only k or c fuses with the following syllable.","ja":"日高西部・千歳方言の k(u)=, c(i)= は、a, u, e, o で始まる語の前で u, i が落ちて、k, c のみが後ろの音節と融合する。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest","doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["before words beginning with a, u, e, o"]},"forms":["k=","ku=","c=","ci="],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0164-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--the-first-person-singular-nominative-prefix-ku-becomes","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--vowel-deletion"],"statement":{"en":"The first-person singular nominative prefix ku- becomes k- before vowels other than i, and shifts the accent to that vowel syllable.","ja":"一人称単数主格 ku- は、i を除く母音で始まる語に付くと k- という形になり、アクセントをその音節に移動させる。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["before non-i vowels"]},"forms":["ku-","k-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0127-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--the-exclusive-first-person-plural-transitive-nominative-prefix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topics":["topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction","topic:phon/personal-affix-sandhi-connected-speech-reduction--vowel-deletion"],"statement":{"en":"The exclusive first-person plural transitive nominative prefix ci- becomes c- before vowels and shifts the accent to that syllable.","ja":"ci-「私達（除外的）が」も母音の前では c- という形になり、アクセントをその音節に移動させる。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["before vowels"]},"forms":["ci-","c-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0128-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-06-38-590Z","status":"grouped"}
